  m_text: "<size=46><color=#FFD65A>Game design & programming</color></size>\n<size=64>Aaron Gutierrez</size>\n\n<size=40><color=#FFD65A>Made for</color></size>\nGINEBR\xD3 GAMES\n\n<size=40><color=#FFD65A>Base project</color></size>\nUnityPlatformerExample (mphc028)\n\n<size=40><color=#FFD65A>Art</color></size>\nLegacy Fantasy \u2013 High Forest pixel art pack\nGINEBR\xD3 GAMES logo, coins, hearts & portal: made for this game\n\n<size=40><color=#FFD65A>Music & sound effects</color></size>\nProcedurally generated for this game\n\n<size=40><color=#FFD65A>Engine</color></size>\nUnity 6000.6.0f1\n\nDAM2 \xB7 Activitat 2 \xB7 Joc de Plataformes 2D"
